    title: "java: a record emits no symbols at all -- record_declaration is not an enclosing type to _get_class_ancestors, so its methods, constructors and the record type vanish from the call graph (Java 16+)"  # bd9f
    status: todo_hard  # bd9f
    priority: 2  # bd9f
